{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-30","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If an odd number measure an even number, it will also measure the half of it.","book":9,"number":30,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.30","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.30/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":30,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","contentId":"euclid-9-30","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8e9bb7c6483bc5268ff47dbdb5375224ff16b7d923da0e71e8c098efa947545","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-30.statement","euclid-9-30.construction.1","euclid-9-30.proof.1","euclid-9-30.proof.2","euclid-9-30.proof.3","euclid-9-30.proof.4","euclid-9-30.proof.5","euclid-9-30.proof.6","euclid-9-30.proof.7","euclid-9-30.conclusion","euclid-9-30.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-30.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cfdca6c69e01f6fedc6625229bb41d1ab09a6582beca9c0211f02317ad69ad5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an odd number measure an even number, it will also measure the half of it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个奇数整除,一个偶数, 它也会整除,一半。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67b36ab0059d767b5b9c6e9d589f7f079bb784f895f384e60ffd19dfb840b49d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the odd number A measure the even number B; I say that it will also measure the half of it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"奇数A 整除,偶数B,我说它也占其中一半的整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"559095cc650fe788eee6d003568fcdba96c259b76421486a1f4ac52990828e26","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A measures B, let it measure it according to C; I say that C is not odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,自A 整除 B以来,根据C,让它整除;我说,C不奇怪。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9cd9fa71c430da369ed027085a7ed1390c168e9ba854439edeb085ea60b3eb53","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be so."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"可能的话,就让它这样吧"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed1a8f7c73f8001fa7b2ee6194a47867ebb789592cd0c6b0490a50105fc73dec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since A measures B according to C, therefore A by multiplying C has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A 整除 B C 乘以C A B 之后 B 已经达到B"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31aa150b859fb9dc5a2b2299fafad90a376b5834da88e776a7b49c84752f7ed6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore B is made up of odd numbers the multitude of which is odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,B是奇数, 其数量之多是奇数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73174277d15412f7890d7b23b7618baa4ae4ddc69ad5269356912b7a58aa76a2","citations":["euclid-9-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore B is odd: [[IX. 23](/principles/euclid-9-23)] which is absurd, for by hypothesis it is even."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,B是奇怪的:这是荒谬的,因为假设是公平的。 [[IX. 23](/principles/euclid-9-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7822d5d2fa7787efe5f3414e17f91429d2e40833cad9da469756c9028981213b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C is not odd; therefore C is even."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C项并不奇怪;因此,C项是均衡的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8e8102d90866f7f2f2afdcbf943788355cdf2f9e5df014d50d516c181bbe1be","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus A measures B an even number of times."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A 整除 B次,甚至多次。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8ad0edc2a2b43bb59c9a0e24acabee15b4f5dc819f8bc053049a381ebd645c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For this reason then it also measures the half of it. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它也占其中一半的整除个。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-30.source","contentId":"euclid-9-30","revisionId":"euclid-9-30@raw-c8e9bb7c6483bc52","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f50850fd184248808deeaa359fdec2ca5c195a71bf4418f38dfb3576cbbe5a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.30/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.30\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-30:euclid-9-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-30.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg